Banana: both RG DS panels at 60.0013 Hz instead of 60.10 Hz

ROCKNIXDS's measured panel fix (dii-ess-aye/device/apply-60hz-dtb.sh), built in: the porches change and the pixel
clock stays 42134 kHz, because pll_vpll is 126.4 MHz and the VOP divides it by a whole number (any lower clock falls
to /4, about 45 Hz). With the real dclk of 42133334 Hz (clk_summary on an RG DS): 42133334 / (1353 x 519) = 60.0013.
A refresh this close to 60 Hz lets SuperDrastic pace DraStic's 60 frames a second with no frame repeated or dropped.

